    "prompt": "In a right triangle, tan θ = 16/12. What is the value of cos θ?",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "12/20",
        "rationale": "Correct."
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "16/20",
        "rationale": "That is sin θ."
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "20/12",
        "rationale": "This inverts cos θ."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "16/12",
        "rationale": "That is tan θ again."
      }
    ],
    "correct_choice": "A",
    "explanation": "From tan θ = 16/12 the sides are opposite 16, adjacent 12, hypotenuse 20 (since 16² + 12² = 20²). So cos θ = 12/20.",
